  Text: "It\u2019s a VTT that crashed right through a <link>\"Don't forget to text
    Mom on her day\" billboard</link>. \n\nThe front is completely caved in at the
    passenger side, it seems like something threw it off the road. Whatever it was,
    <link>it was BIG</link>. \r\n\r  \n<link>The cargo compartment</link> is sealed
    now. \n "
  TextForRepetition: 'We already did that, remember?

    The report is probably
    on your desk, or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
